|---|---|
| Codex / Cursor | [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) |
| Claude | [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) |
| Workflow changes | [openspec/](openspec/) |
| Raw intake | [inbox/README.md](inbox/README.md) |
| Knowledge navigation | [wiki/index.md](wiki/index.md) |

